-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",190,{
[6049]="7006B0E8\n1\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier I ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks and prospectors in Thorin's Hall as they endeavour to make hard tack for an upcoming expedition. Haul ore, catch fish, collect items from the nearby larder, or undertake any other available tasks to earn commendations.\n2\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier II ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks and prospectors in Thorin's Hall as they endeavour to make hard tack for an upcoming expedition. Haul ore, catch fish, collect items from the nearby larder, or undertake any other available tasks to earn commendations.\n3\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier III ([see journal]/10)\tAid the cooks and prospectors in Thorin's Hall as they endeavour to make hard tack for an upcoming expedition. Haul ore, catch fish, collect items from the nearby larder, or undertake any other available tasks to earn commendations.\n4\tSpeak to the Thorin's Hall Event Coordinator\tYou provided an enormous contribution to the Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall event and should visit the coordinator for your final reward.\n",
[6050]="7006B0FE\n1\tCollect fish for the cooks helping the community ([see journal]/5)\tFish up the tasty fish in the pond in the cavern.\n2\tDeliver the fish to a fish barrel\tYou caught ten fish from the pond in the cavern. You should deliver those to a fish barrel near the cooks making dishes to help those helping to make hard tack.\n",
[6051]="7006B0F5\n1\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier I ([see journal]/5)\tAid the community of Thorin's Hall to inspire, hearten, and strengthen those assisting the cooks as they craft hard tack for an expedition. You will need to execute special recipes and deliver your creations for everyone involved.\n2\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier II ([see journal]/5)\tAid the community of Thorin's Hall to inspire, hearten, and strengthen those assisting the cooks as they craft hard tack for an expedition. You will need to execute special recipes and deliver your creations for everyone involved.\n3\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier III ([see journal]/5)\tAid the community of Thorin's Hall to inspire, hearten, and strengthen those assisting the cooks as they craft hard tack for an expedition. You will need to execute special recipes and deliver your creations for everyone involved.\n4\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier IV ([see journal]/5)\tAid the community of Thorin's Hall to inspire, hearten, and strengthen those assisting the cooks as they craft hard tack for an expedition. You will need to execute special recipes and deliver your creations for everyone involved.\n5\tSpeak with the Coordinator at the Thorin's Hall event space\tYour assistance in feeding and slaking the thirst of those assisting the cooks to craft hard tack is complete. You exceeded expectations and should visit the coordinator to receive your final reward.\n",
[6052]="7006B0F7\n1\tLook at veins for ever-burning ore\030Find a suitable ore node\tMake your way through the tunnels and caverns to discover a vein of ever-burning ore to prospect.\n",
[6053]="7006B213\n1\tCollect a mushroom crate from the larder\030Collect spice from the larder\tTo keep the sneaky hobbits from interfering with the stoking of the furnace, you were asked to feed them a little too much spice in their mushrooms. Collect mushrooms and spice from the larder.\n2\tYou sprinkle the spices onto the mushrooms and shake them around, concealing the additive. Deliver the crate to a sneaky hobbit.\t\n",
[6054]="7006B0F9\n1\tProspect a laden ever-burning node\tProspect laden ever-burning ore nodes to release a harvestable chunk of the ore.\n",
[6055]="7006B0FF\n1\tDeliver a large piece of ever-burning ore to a mine-cart\tCollect a large chunk of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver it to a mine-cart in the area of the Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall event. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6056]="7006B0FD\n1\tCollect and deliver a medium-sized chunk of ever-burning ore to an ore cart\tCollect a medium-sized chunk of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver them to an ore cart in the area of the Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall event. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tCollect and deliver a medium-sized chunk of ever-burning ore to a mine-cart\tCollect another medium-sized chunks of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver them to an ore cart in the area of the Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall event. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6057]="7006B0DC\n1\tCollect deep mushrooms from around the cave (total: 5)\030Collect a crate of mushrooms from the larder\tCollect mushrooms from the caves where the dwarves of Thorin's Hall are making Hard Tack or collect a crate from the nearby larder and deliver the items to the cook station in the main area.\n2\tDeliver a mushroom crate to the cook's station\030Deliver mushrooms to the cook's station\tDeliver the mushrooms you gathered to the cook's station in the main area.\n",
[6058]="7006B671\n1\tDeliver a snack to a lazy prospector\tMake your way into the larder and collect a crate of mushrooms, then deliver the mushrooms to one of the sluggard miners milling about in the cavern below. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6059]="7006B0F4\n1\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier I ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks of Thorin's Hall to keep the cook-fires burning while they make hard tack for an expedition under the mountains.\n2\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier II ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks of Thorin's Hall to keep the cook-fires burning while they make hard tack for an expedition under the mountains.\n3\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier III ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks of Thorin's Hall to keep the cook-fires burning while they make hard tack for an expedition under the mountains.\n4\tEarn Thorin's Hall Commendations - Tier IV ([see journal]/5)\tAid the cooks of Thorin's Hall to keep the cook-fires burning while they make hard tack for an expedition under the mountains.\n5\tSpeak with the Coordinator at the Thorin's Hall event space\tYou exceeded expectations and performed feats of near perfection. You should visit the coordinator and speak to them for final acknowledgment.\n",
[6060]="7006B0FA\n1\tProspect a rich ever-burning node\tProspect rich ever-burning ore nodes to release harvestable chunks of the ore.\n",
[6061]="7006B214\n1\tCollect a flagon of ale from the larder\tMake your way to the larder, collect a flagon of ale and deliver it to a sluggard miner to set them to sleep for a while. This will make the halls safer for transporting ever-burning ore. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6062]="7006B0FB\n1\tDeliver a small chunk of ever-burning ore to a mine-cart\tCollect small chunks of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver it to an ore cart inside of the event space for Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tDeliver a small chunk of ever-burning ore to a mine-cart\tCollect another small chunk of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver it to an ore cart inside of the event space for Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDeliver a small chunk of ever-burning ore to a mine-cart\tCollect one more small chunk of harvested ever-burning ore and deliver it to an ore cart inside of the event space for Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6063]="7006B1F8\n1\tCollect an ale ingredient from the nearby keg\030Collect a mushroom ingredient from the mushroom crate\030Collect a spice ingredient from the spice rack\tCollect the ingredients needed to craft the Thorin's Hall Brew from the nearby mushrooms, keg, and spice rack.\n2\tCraft Thorin's Hall Brew\tCraft the Thorin's Brew beverage, then deliver it to a brew table to help all the workers perform at their peak.\n3\tComplete the brew in the oven and deliver it to the table\tYou made Thorin's Hall Brew. Complete your brew in the oven and the deliver it to a brew table. Be careful to avoid sneaky hobbits. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tPlace the Thorin's Hall Brew on a brew table\tPlace the brew onto the brew table.\n",
[6064]="7006B1FC\n1\tCollect the fish ingredient from the fish barrel\030Collect the mushroom ingredient from the mushroom crate\030Collect the spice craft ingredient from the spice rack\tCollect the ingredients needed to craft the Thorin's Hall Brew from the nearby fish barrel, mushrooms crate, and spice rack.\n2\tCreate a Thorin's Hall Hearty Meal then deliver it to a meal table to help all the workers perform at their peak.\t\n3\tComplete the meal in the oven then deliver it to the table\tYou made a Thorin's Hall Hearty Meal. Complete the meal in the oven and deliver it to a meal table. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tPlace the hearty meal onto a meal table\tPlace the Thorin's Hall Hearty Meal onto a meal table.\n",
[6065]="7006B1FD\n1\tCollect craft ingredients from the spice rack\030Collect mushroom ingredients from the mushroom crate\tCollect the ingredients needed to craft the Thorin's Hall Brew from the nearby mushroom crate and spice rack.\n2\tCraft a Thorin's Hall Mushroom Snack\tCraft a Thorin's Hall Mushroom Snack then deliver it to a snack table to help all the workers perform at their peak.\n3\tComplete the snack in the oven and deliver it to the table\tYou made a Thorin's Hall Mushroom Snack. Complete the snack in an oven and deliver it to a snack table. Avoid sneaky hobbits. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tPlace the snack onto a snack table\tDeliver the Thorin's Hall Snack to a snack table.\n",
[6066]="7006B100\n1\tCollect a jar of spice from the larder\tCooks making dishes that help to speed movement, grant strength, and hasten actions while the dwarves make hard tack require spice from the larder. Collect the spice from the larder and deliver it to a spice rack in the main room.\n2\tDeliver the jar of spice to the spice rack\tYou collected the jar of spice from the larder. Now place the jar of spice on the spice rack near where the cooks making snacks, drinks, and meals are cooking.\n",
[6067]="7006B0F6\n1\tProspect a weak ever-burning node\tProspect weak ever-burning ore nodes of ever-burning to release harvestable chunks of the ore.\n",
[6068]="7006B5D3\n1\tTalk to Ingúl Ovestoke\tSpeak with Ingúl Ovestoke near the ovens in Ukhbab-gairu to learn the recipes needed to participate in the Hard Tack of Thorin's Hall event.\n",
[6069]="700582DB\n1\tSearch for evidence of Karazgar in Wyrmsgráf\tWyrmsgráf can be found in Elderslade. You should search for evidence of Karazgar in Wyrmsgráf.\n2\tRead the note found in Karazgar's hideout\tA note addressed to you can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should read the note.\n3\tTalk to Léothred in Wyrmsgráf\tLéothred can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Léothred.\n4\tSearch for evidence of Scatha's hoard\tWyrmsgráf can be found in Elderslade. You should search for evidence of Scatha's hoard.\n5\tTalk to Fróthi in Wyrmsgráf\tFróthi can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Fróthi.\n6\tCollect some of Scatha's hoard for Fróthi (total: 4)\tWyrmsgráf can be found in Elderslade. You should collect some of Scatha's hoard for Fróthi.\n7\tTalk to Léothred in Wyrmsgráf\tLéothred can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Léothred.\n8\tTalk to Fróthi in Wyrmsgráf\tFróthi can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Fróthi.\n9\tTalk to Léothred in Wyrmsgráf\tLéothred can be found in Wyrmsgráf. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[6070]="70042EBD\n1\tDefeat Half-trolls at Harlanc\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Half-trolls at Harlanc.\n2\tDefeat Half-trolls at Harlanc (total: 5)\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Half-trolls at Harlanc.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Half-trolls at Harlanc.\n",
[6071]="70042EC0\n1\tDefeat Haradrim Captains at Harlanc\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Haradrim Captains at Harlanc.\n2\tDefeat Haradrim Captains at Harlanc (total: 3)\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Haradrim Captains at Harlanc.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Haradrim Captains at Harlanc.\n",
[6072]="70042EC1\n1\tTake sashes from defeated Haradrim at Harlanc\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should collect sashes off the Haradrim you defeat in Harlanc.\n2\tCollect sashes from Haradrim at Harlanc (total: 10)\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should collect sashes off the Haradrim you defeat in Harlanc.\n3\tBring the Haradrim sashes to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should show Thurindol the sashes you have collected from the Haradrim.\n",
[6073]="70042EBF\n1\tRetrieve Ranger Supplies from within Harlanc\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should enter the central building in the ruins at Harlanc.\n2\tEnter the centre structure at Harlanc\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should enter the central building in the ruins at Harlanc.\n3\tRetrieve Ranger supplies (total: 10)\030Defeat Haradrim looters (total: 4)\tHarlanc is located south of Bâr Húrin. You should retrieve Ranger supplies from within the ruins at Harlanc.\n4\tReturn the supplies to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should return the Ranger supplies you recovered to Thurindol.\n",
[6074]="7004D701\n1\tRetrieve Hithlos's mop\tA mop can be found near Hithlos in Felegoth. You should retrieve the mop and assist Hithlos with his work.\n2\tClean up spills (total: 12)\tVarious spills and such can be found in and around the old jail cells in Felegoth. You should clean up spills.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have assisted Hithlos in his task.\n",
[6075]="70054CA3\n1\tDestroy Orkish weapons (total: 8)\tOrkish weapons can be found within the Harrowing of Morgul. You should destroy any Orkish weapons that you find.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many Orkish weapons.\n",
[6076]="70054C9D\n1\tGather supplies (total: 8)\tAdditional supplies can be found within the Harrowing of Morgul. You should gather any additional supplies that you find.\n2\tReturn to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found at Echad Uial. You should bring the additional supplies to Ereblen.\n",
[6077]="7001E985\n1\tDefeat Hîshtgropor sentries (total: 10)\tSentries can be found on the outskirts of Ânug-stazg, east of Mithechad. Perindúr asked you to defeat the sentries of Ânug-stazg, allowing the Malledhrim to lay siege to the encampment.\n2\tTalk to Perindúr in Mithechad\tPerindúr is at Mithechad, west of Ânug-stazg. You should return to Perindúr with news of your success against the sentries of Ânug-stazg.\n",
[6078]="7000EF7A\n1\tBring the bear-haunches to Raija\030Collect bear-haunches (total: 12)\tBears can be found throughout Jä-rannit. Once you have the meat, bring it to Raija in Karhu-leiri. Raija has asked you to replenish their stores with bear-meat.\n",
[6079]="70072F8F\n1\tCollect blight samples east of Sul Madásh (total: 12)\tMálacál has asked that you travel east of Sul Madásh and gather any Pale Blight samples you can from the beasts there for the scholars to study.\n2\tReturn to Málacál\tReturn to Málacál near Sul Madásh and give them the samples of the Pale Blight gathered for the scholars.\n",
[6080]="7000C6CB\n1\tTalk to Amabel Redfern\tAmabel Redfern is near the Party Tree in Hobbiton. You should speak to Amabel Redfern again to receive your black mushroom transplant.\n",
})
